1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,867
Speaking, task three. Story number 9: At the office. What did Mr Kovač do yesterday? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:10,567 --> 00:00:12,187
What did Mr Kovač do yesterday?

3
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:36,229
Yesterday Mr Kovač went to the office because he needed a new document.

4
00:00:36,433 --> 00:00:38,118
There were a lot of people at the office.

5
00:00:38,333 --> 00:00:41,167
He had to wait in the queue for a long time, almost an hour.

6
00:00:41,367 --> 00:00:43,187
Then he filled in a form.

7
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:46,554
He wrote his name, address and date of birth there.

8
00:00:46,767 --> 00:00:49,628
He didn't know some things, so he asked the clerk.

9
00:00:49,833 --> 00:00:51,933
Then he had to have a photo taken for the new document.

10
00:00:52,133 --> 00:00:53,824
The photo was ready right away.

11
00:00:54,033 --> 00:00:56,333
Finally the clerk gave him a confirmation.

12
00:00:56,533 --> 00:00:59,424
She told him he could collect the document in a month.

13
00:00:59,633 --> 00:01:07,740
Tell story 9 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
